    "ciphertext": "~022079013853770990212",
    "title": "New Website <span class=\"highlight\">Development</span> - w/<span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> Integrations",
    "description": "1. Job Title\n<span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> <span class=\"highlight\">Developer</span> Needed for Premium Sports Lifestyle Brand (www.meggd.com)\nTo compete in a market that has few competitors in the US (www.bootink.com and itrupo.com\n\n2. Skills\n<span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span>\n<span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> Customization\nE-Commerce Website\nMobile Design\nWeb Design\nMailchimp\nPayments Integrations\n\n3. Scope\nBuilding the entire website from scratch. We are looking to keep it pretty small for launch. \n\n4. Level of Expertise\nExpert or Intermediate\n(Choose Expert if you want someone who can independently lead the design translation and best practices. Choose Intermediate if you want a balance of solid experience and cost-efficiency).\n\n5. Location: Atlanta GA\n\n6. Budget & Contract Type\nHourly\n\nBudget Estimate: TBD\n\n7. Description\nWe are seeking a skilled <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> <span class=\"highlight\">developer</span> with a deep understanding of e-commerce best practices and a proven track record of launching high-converting storefronts. In this role, you will customize themes to seamlessly reflect our premium, high-contrast brand identity, configure secure payment gateways, and ensure a flawless, mobile-first responsive design.\n\nProject Overview:\n\nWhat We Are Seeking:\nWe are seeking a skilled <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> <span class=\"highlight\">developer</span> with a deep understanding of e-commerce best practices and a proven track record of launching high-converting storefronts. In this role, you will customize themes to seamlessly reflect our premium, high-contrast brand identity, configure secure payment gateways, and ensure a flawless, mobile-first responsive design.\n\n\nProven experience building and customizing <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> themes (please share portfolio links, ideally for sports, apparel, or lifestyle brands).\nStrong focus on clean mobile layout optimization and rapid page loading.\nAbility to work independently to bring our existing brand assets (logo/visual guidelines) to life in a functional digital store.",
